\ A file with no ancestor manifest. Resolution falls back to the user-level
\ manifest (`global_sooth.pkg` beside this file stands in for
\ `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/sooth/global_sooth.pkg`), which is where `core` comes from.
\ With no user-level manifest either, this file would be an implicit anonymous
\ package: `intrinsics` and its own siblings only, and the two lines below
\ would be located errors naming the missing manifest.
import: intrinsics i | * | ;
import: core::bool b | if | ;
import: core::text t | upper? | ;

: main ( -- ) 65 upper? ~[ 1 ] ~[ 0 ] if . ;
